  "_comment": "Super-Signals registry, grouped by category. Three super_signal_bot.py instances (one per category: --category etf|stock|crypto) drive the ENABLED tickers in their group. Toggle a ticker with enabled:true/false — the supervisor re-reads this file each cycle. A-book aggregates the A-signals across ALL enabled tickers and pins to the top of the desk. Paths are relative to this file's folder (super_research/).",
